40	 *  their due-total for each period (see `personPeriodDue`), the due of their open claims by age (see `agedDues`), their overdue claims (OPEN ones past their due-by; the count and their due added up) and their claims, each
41	 *  with a checkbox that selects it for a button that opens the selected claims together.
42	 *  Each person has a checkbox that selects them for a grade given to the selected people together.
43	 *  Retired people are left out of the list unless "show retired" is on; their claims still count.
44	 *  Whether each person is active (see `isActive`). Their cut total (see `personCutTotal`).
45	 *  A picker and a button merge the person into another (see `mergePerson`), and an entry and a
